The ZAEON Studio feature set (lib/studio/*, app/api/studio/*) adapts ideas from
open-notebook, in particular:

  - The podcast pipeline (outline -> transcript -> multi-speaker synthesis) and
    its prompt strategy, adapted in lib/studio/podcast.ts from
    open-notebook's prompts/podcast/outline.jinja and transcript.jinja.
  - The content "transformations" concept (study guide, FAQ, summary, etc.),
    adapted in lib/studio/transformations.ts from open-notebook's default
    transformation definitions.

The patterns were re-implemented for the Zaeon stack on Google GenAI models
(Gemini for scripting + Gemini-TTS for voice). No source code was copied
verbatim. open-notebook is distributed under the MIT License; the original
copyright and permission notice apply to the upstream work.

